prompt_template:
Create one finished premium editorial campaign poster in {ASPECT_RATIO}. Visual system: obsidian signal motion. Apply these prioritized rules: {STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
New subject: {SUBJECT}
Design intention: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Select the correct composition for the requested ratio: {RATIO_LAYOUTS}
Render exactly two text elements, no other lettering: headline "{MAIN_TEXT}" and supporting line "{SECONDARY_TEXT}". Compact extended geometric sans-serif, gently squared rounded shapes, medium-bold headline and smaller supporting text; quiet scale, clean glyphs, high contrast and generous safe margins. Typography is subordinate to the photographic silhouette, never distorted.
Photoreal material and believable forms. Bright diffuse backlight with controlled underexposure; preserve shadow contours. Very fine low-amplitude photographic grain in white and shadows, smooth horizontal translucent smearing only in the trailing zone, focal edges clean. Palette cool white, near-black, charcoal and localized saturated ember orange. Keep the picture sparse and deliberate. Avoid these source contents: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}. No logos, watermarks, UI, QR codes, generic neon grids, decorative particles, extra text, contact sheet, border or frame.
